    "title": "Get Authorized Category Assets",
    "version": "202405",
    "description": "Retrieves the list of business category assets authorized by a partner for an app.\nPartner authorization is required before an app can access the data of a partner, and this access is granted based on business categories. Use this API to check which business category assets are currently authorized for an app and obtain the corresponding category asset cipher for use as an input parameter in affiliate partner related APIs.\nFor more information about partner authorization, refer to [Partner authorization guide](678e3a3978f4c20311b8b555).\nTarget partner: All"
  },
